{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/valiantSaga.jpg?t=1746026298\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The consequences of a bloody war in the past return after decades. The kingdoms of Dohendall and Auberon must ally to defeat an ancestral evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rumors say that a Necromancer would have awakened in the Abyssal Lands, the inhospitable refuge of the most cruel and visceral beasts that the world has ever faced and would be planning a darkness and fearful new era. No one really knows if this is true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a beginner warrior from the kingdom of Dohendall, novice of an ancient dwarf master who taught you the powerful two-handed axe combat art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your first mission will be to investigate the adventurers group disappearance near the feared Temple of Agony. Explore terrifying locations, find relics and overcome your limits in brutal battles against abysmal enemies horde!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IMPRESSIVE VISUAL EFFECTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Valiant Saga follows the classic platform games but with pixelated art mixed with modern lighting and shading effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/valiantThunder.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FREEDOM AND EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a level progression system accessed through a map with all kingdoms that you can go back to search for new secrets or hidden places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/exploration-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VISCERAL FIGHTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash the power of the inherited axe from your master and defeat without mercy all enemies that dare to stay in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/valiant-saga-visceral-fighting-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RPG FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be able to meet people of different villages on side missions, solve challenging puzzles in the game and collect different types of items that will help you along this adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/vs-rpg-features-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EPIC BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To stay alive you will need to overcome the most terrible creatures and they will be increasingly deadly and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/vs-epic-battles-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE DESTINY OF VALIANTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to pass over several traps through dungeons and abandoned temples. The fear will be your only company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/destiny-of-braves-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE VALIANT SOUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Valiant Saga has a totally original power metal soundtrack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1526890?t=1746026298","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1526890?t=1746026298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746026298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746026298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/valiantSaga.jpg?t=1746026298\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The consequences of a bloody war in the past return after decades. The kingdoms of Dohendall and Auberon must ally to defeat an ancestral evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rumors say that a Necromancer would have awakened in the Abyssal Lands, the inhospitable refuge of the most cruel and visceral beasts that the world has ever faced and would be planning a darkness and fearful new era. No one really knows if this is true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a beginner warrior from the kingdom of Dohendall, novice of an ancient dwarf master who taught you the powerful two-handed axe combat art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your first mission will be to investigate the adventurers group disappearance near the feared Temple of Agony. Explore terrifying locations, find relics and overcome your limits in brutal battles against abysmal enemies horde!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>IMPRESSIVE VISUAL EFFECTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Valiant Saga follows the classic platform games but with pixelated art mixed with modern lighting and shading effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/valiantThunder.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FREEDOM AND EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a level progression system accessed through a map with all kingdoms that you can go back to search for new secrets or hidden places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/exploration-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VISCERAL FIGHTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash the power of the inherited axe from your master and defeat without mercy all enemies that dare to stay in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/valiant-saga-visceral-fighting-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RPG FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be able to meet people of different villages on side missions, solve challenging puzzles in the game and collect different types of items that will help you along this adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/vs-rpg-features-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EPIC BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To stay alive you will need to overcome the most terrible creatures and they will be increasingly deadly and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/vs-epic-battles-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE DESTINY OF VALIANTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to pass over several traps through dungeons and abandoned temples. The fear will be your only company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1526890/extras/destiny-of-braves-2.gif?t=1746026298\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE VALIANT SOUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Valiant Saga has a totally original power metal soundtrack.</p>","developers":["Pixhitt"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st